        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/reckless/{size}/2467_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-03-13T21:16:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The main reason why they omitted the card destroying itself was actually because they ran out of room on the card!&nbsp; However, it worked out quite well thematically, since (as already mentioned) an \"Ultimate Target\" should result in a victory if he/she/it is downed.&nbsp; It's fun coincidences like that which make me really happy that I became a playtester!</p>",
